{
  "analysis": "The output was truncated. I can see the workspace has a config directory, memory directory with clawdbot-sync subdirectory containing config.json, history.json, peers.json, and a conflicts directory. There's also a skills directory with sample-skill. I need to read the documentation and all configuration files to understand the sync system.",
